  "name": "drowned",
  "about": "The Tidecaller's Drowned Vault: a way into a sea cliff of dark banded rock half sunk in the sand, framed by two posts of standing rock and two carved ship's knees under a dark timber lintel, a portcullis of timber lattice in it over darkness, an anchor of studded iron leaning on its post with a chain slung across its face, a wreck's bow and stern half buried either side, a fallen stone bell, olive planking strewn, kelp hanging from the arch, green sea-fire in rock fonts either side of the way in. Made by the pack-drowned team's script (scratchpad look.py). Things below y 0 are buried.",
